{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>The horns of the altar of burnt offering.</b> The anointed priest and the congregation, who draw near and are esteemed before the Holy One, blessed be He — their blood of atonement is offered inside, on the parokhet and on the golden altar. And their sin presses to burn their hattat outside the three camps, according to the greatness of their punishment. A ruler and an individual, who do not draw near and are not so esteemed — the blood of their atonement and the emurim of their hattat are upon the outer altar, and the flesh is eaten."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:59.979539553Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}